{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"7831f6fd-5a05-4494-91ae-a58e957c2828","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Target File\n- [date_range.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-001_32564_1795292541879_icm_lite/date_range.py)\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n1. **Inclusive start, exclusive end**: Returns ISO date strings (`YYYY-MM-DD`) starting at `start_date` up to, but excluding, `end_date`.\n2. **Equal boundary**: Returns `[]` when `start_date == end_date`.\n3. **Single-day range**: For consecutive days, returns `[start_date]`.\n4. **Reversed range**: Raises `ValueError(\"start_date must not be after end_date\")` when `start_date \u003e end_date`.\n5. **Invalid inputs**: Raises `ValueError(\"Invalid date format, expected YYYY-MM-DD\")` if parsing fails or input is not a valid date string/`date` object.\n6. **Step days**: Raises `ValueError(\"step_days must be a positive integer\")` when `step_days \u003c= 0`.\n7. **Transitions**: Correctly handles month/year transitions and leap years.\n8. **Types**: Accepts both `str` (`YYYY-MM-DD`) and `datetime.date` objects.\n\n### Symbol Inspection \u0026 Applied Changes\nInspected functions:\n- `_parse_date`: Added validation catching invalid string formats and non-string/non-date types, raising `ValueError(\"Invalid date format, expected YYYY-MM-DD\")`.\n- `generate_date_range`:\n  - Added validation for `step_days \u003c= 0` raising `ValueError(\"step_days must be a positive integer\")`.\n  - Added check for `start \u003e end` raising `ValueError(\"start_date must not be after end_date\")`.\n  - Changed progression loop condition from `current \u003c= end` to `current \u003c end` to enforce exclusive upper bound and handle equal boundaries.\n\n### Automated Verification\nExecuted verification suite covering:\n- Basic progression, exclusive upper bound, and equal boundary.\n- Single-day range and step progression (`step_days=2`).\n- Invalid inputs, non-date types, invalid format handling, and reversed range exceptions.\n- Month/year transitions (including leap year 2024-02-29).\n- Interoperability between `str` and `datetime.date` types.\n- Visible test suite in [tests/test_visible.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-001_32564_1795292541879_icm_lite/tests/test_visible.py).\n\n**Result**: All assertions and tests passed (`ALL CHECKS PASSED`).\n\n### Remaining Risk\nNone identified. All contract boundary conditions and explicit exception messages are covered and verified.\n","duration_seconds":44.6072433,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":48083,"output_tokens":2683,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":219054,"total_tokens":50766}}}
